                                                "sense_id": "feaef14b-7bae-3718-9363-b6432178c243",
                                                "text": "Yvonne and Lee Swee potatoed Deputy Lestrade multiple times before Sheriff Moran potatoed them both. […] Suddenly, Sheriff Moran heard the click click of an empty weapon. He turned to see that both Mayor Eliza and Kat had run out of ammunition."
                                            }
